---
const GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL = 'https://github.com/avolaunch/relay-protocol';
---
<section class="hero" id="top"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">An open protocol, still taking shape</p><h1>Relay Protocol</h1><p class="statement">Your digital presence should not belong to the applications you use.</p><p class="supporting">Relay is exploring an open protocol architecture for identity, data, relationships and application permissions that exist independently of any single app or provider. It's early — the design is public, but the specification isn't stable yet.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="btn is-primary" href="#architecture">Explore the architecture</a><a class="btn is-secondary" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub</a></div></div></section>
<style>.hero{padding-block:clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem) clamp(3rem,8vw,5rem);border-top:none}.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.875rem;color:var(--text-faint);margin-bottom:1.25rem}.hero h1{color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem}.statement{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2.2vw,1.375rem);color:var(--accent-strong);max-width:34rem;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.supporting{max-width:36rem;font-size:1.0625rem}</style>
